  "text": "## Charter  \n### 1. Definition  \n**Internal Audit:** An independent, objective function that evaluates the adequacy and effectiveness of FirstUK Bank's risk management, control, and governance processes.  \n**Independence:** Internal Audit reports directly to Board Audit Committee, not to management, ensuring impartiality.  \n---",
